flowchart LR
    A[branch off main] --> B["tools/prereview.py<br/>every gate"]
    B --> C[checklist review<br/>REVIEW_CHECKLIST.md]
    C --> D["tools/pr.py create<br/>a draft while iterating"]
    D --> E["mark ready<br/>CI + one review per bot"]
    E --> F{findings?}
    F -- yes --> G[fix them all in one push,<br/>reply to every one]
    G --> H
    F -- no --> H["tools/pr.py merge<br/>(green + reviewed once,<br/>every finding answered)"]
